          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP667 Riversong [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Very banged up/pretty much unreadable from what I could tell, but an easy and scenic find after a nearby traditional.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683863972">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-05T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7573673">geoCurious2</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP667 - Riversong&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having discovered that we actually had a few more days to record Brass Caps, we went out today to get some more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;North on 22 into the south side of Cochrane to get this one and several regular caches.  The field was alive with flowering crocus!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684223579">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP667 - Riversong&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, picking up ones we didn't get to earlier! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; A busy day today and lots of walking, but a lot of fun!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; I know I've driven by this cap a couple of times.  Each time I looked at it and groaned at the long walk.  Today OBA made it a drive up for us!! What a great view!!  Very quiet up here too! TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683872123">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="540154">One Bad Ant</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP667 - Riversong - I have been up here looking for caches before, I chose a much better parking spot this time. The views from up here are amazing. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Phoenix and I spent the day continuing our Calgary and area capping spree. Thanks for the work you do maintaining the caps outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="682462306">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-30T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1636194">behmSquad</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP667 Riversong&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I'm down to a final day to add to my large cap haul this month. This cap would be one of twelve that I found this afternoon pushing my total for the month into three digits. Today was focused on a few caps on the western outskirts of Calgary and those in and around Cochrane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I found a couple of options for parking near this cap.  I wisely chose the high road location.  The half km walk to the cap location led to a very nice overlook of Cochrane.  The cap was quickly found.  Thanks for the cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
      </groundspeak:logs>
